# What the images build from is a curated subset of the tree — each Dockerfile
# COPYs explicit paths — so this list is about the *cache*, not correctness:
# anything reaching the daemon becomes part of a COPY's cache key, and a build
# artifact that churns every time would invalidate layers no source change did.
#
# docker/pyodide-mt/served/ is deliberately NOT excluded: the ~70 MB threaded
# Pyodide 314 runtime is a build INPUT the web image ships verbatim, prepared on
# the host by `mise run fetch-pyodide` (or built by build-all.sh).

.git
.github
.claude
.agents
**/.DS_Store

# Build outputs. The images produce their own.
target
dist
dist-py
node_modules
web/gen
web/proto

# Tool caches and scratch trees.
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.lycheecache
scratchpad
tests/parity/.artifacts
tests/parity/corpus/data
docker/pyodide-mt/.work
docker/pyodide-mt/out
docker/pyodide-pthread

# Nothing here is an input to the web or proxy image: the Pyodide *builder*
# (as against its output in served/), the Qt frontend's own image context, the
# test suites, and the prose.
docker/pyodide-mt/browser-test
docker/pyodide-mt/patches
docker/pyodide-mt/pyrocko
qt
tests
plan
typings
snuffler-initial.png

# The pyrocko checkout is 80 MB of source the image needs exactly two things
# from — the cake earthmodels and the map's plate boundaries, both staged by
# crates/snuffler-web-egui/index.html. Ship those two, leave the clone (and its
# 26 MB of git objects) out of the context entirely.
sources/**
!sources/pyrocko/src/data/earthmodels/**
!sources/pyrocko/src/gui/snuffler/snufflings/map/plates.kml
